          "size": "m",
          "text": "The projector",
          "entry": "e4dcxkrv",
          "col": 1,
          "row": 2,
          "w": 6
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "h": 8,
          "size": "m",
          "text": "For the body of the projector I used ceramics because of the organic nature of this project. I molded 3d printed sphere in to plaster and used the cut off as the stand for the projector. The glazes are inspired by the failed experiments which came before, and the color that the beet faded in to if not preserved.\nThe electronics are a Cob Led, Heat sync and a power supply which are amplified by a distance adjustable convex-lens. Which al together creates the \"Slice Of Beet\" beet projector.",
